// OTD-0004 - Modbus FC08 Diagnostic Restart or Force Listen-Only Mode
// Source: 02-detection/sigma/core-protocol/modbus-fc08-restart.yml
// ATT&CK for ICS: attack.t0816
// Severity: high
// PLACEHOLDERS in <angle brackets> must be baselined before use.
//
OTNetwork_CL
| where (FunctionCode == "DIAGNOSTICS") and (SubFunction in (1, 4))
| project TimeGenerated, SourceIP, DestinationIP, Protocol, FunctionCode, AccountName, Computer
| order by TimeGenerated desc
